  "description": "Microsoft SQL Server database provider for Rapidex.Data ORM framework.\n\n\t\t\tThis package provides SQL Server specific implementation for the Rapidex.Data framework, enabling full support for Microsoft SQL Server databases.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• Full SQL Server support for Rapidex.Data\n\t\t\t• Optimized SQL generation for SQL Server\n\t\t\t• Support for SQL Server specific data types\n\t\t\t• Transaction support with SQL Server\n\t\t\t• Multi-schema support\n\t\t\t• Automatic schema creation and updates\n\t\t\t• Connection pooling support\n\n\t\t\tRequires Rapidex.Data package (which includes all necessary dependencies).",
